('enc1968', 'historija', 'Šta je prema Enciklopediji Jugoslavije iz 1968. Sanski Most imao, uz pilanu i ciglanu?', 'According to the 1968 Encyclopaedia of Yugoslavia, what did Sanski Most have, besides a sawmill and a brickworks?', '["Brodogradilište","Rudnik uglja u Kamengradu","Rafineriju nafte","Staklaru"]', '["A shipyard","A coal mine at Kamengrad","An oil refinery","A glassworks"]', '2', 'Rudnik uglja u Kamengradu, uz građevinsko i električno preduzeće, tvornicu panel-ploča i stovarište duhana.', 'A coal mine at Kamengrad, as well as a construction and an electrical company, a panel board factory and a tobacco depot.', 'Općina Sanski Most: Historija općine', 'https://sanskimost.gov.ba/historija-opcine-sanski-most/'),
